      "content": "800mg every 6 hours? is that safe though? i already took like 400mg an hour ago so i dont want to mess up my stomach or something. also the pain is kinda weird, it feels more like a tearing feeling than just a dull ache. do you think it could be something more serious than a muscle strain or am i just overthinking it?",
